{"availability":"available","full":"drthyang/web-refinement","name":"web-refinement","description":"MATERIA — Rietveld, single-crystal F², magnetic-structure and PDF refinement in the browser on one pure-TypeScript engine, with an in-app AI Agent (42 tools; every change approved and undoable; skills read on demand) and a 40-tool MCP server.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-06T05:46:00Z","updated":"2026-10-17T17:09:57Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://drthyang.github.io/web-refinement/","topics":["ai-agents","crystallography","llm","local-llm","magnetic-structure","materials-science","mcp","neutron-diffraction","pair-distribution-function","rietveld","tool-calling","total-scattering","typescript","webapp","x-ray-diffraction"],"demo":"https://drthyang.github.io/web-refinement/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.149Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.149Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.149Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:07:06.376Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:12:12.572Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:03:58.820Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T03:24:37.082Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T18:01:05.755Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.149Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Crystal and magnetic structure refinement that runs entirely in your browser, built to be driven by people and by AI agents.","An Agent works the analysis with you. Open it beside a powder, single-crystal or PDF fit and a model of your choice — local on Ollama or LM Studio, or in the cloud — runs the refinement by your written method, says why a fit is poor, names the phase behind an extra peak, finds a magnetic structure, checks an unconvincing number with a Bayesian posterior, and reports the result with esds. It asks before every change, or works through the stages on its own in Auto. Its methods are skills it reads on demand, its firm rules are code, and an eval suite replays the failures it once had in CI. How…","▶ Try it: drthyang.github.io/web-refinement — nothing to install, and the analysis runs on your machine (the Agent sends its conversation only to the model you choose: nowhere else for a local model, to the provider's API for a cloud one). Two demos open already converged: a two-phase Mn₃Ga neutron TOF Rietveld fit and a GaTa₄Se₈ X-ray PDF fit."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/drthyang/web-refinement/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"88bff759adc059e515d5e6e1b0059396bcea846f4a7c9e7159e8bf7751765e06","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.257Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.257Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Crystal and magnetic structure refinement that runs entirely in your browser, built to be driven by people and by AI agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/drthyang/web-refinement/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"88bff759adc059e515d5e6e1b0059396bcea846f4a7c9e7159e8bf7751765e06","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/drthyang/web-refinement/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.257Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-17T17:09:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/drthyang/web-refinement/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.257Z","hash":"88bff759adc059e515d5e6e1b0059396bcea846f4a7c9e7159e8bf7751765e06","originalBytes":8525,"storedBytes":8525,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:42.149Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://drthyang.github.io/web-refinement/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T20:13:07.976Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T20:13:07.976Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-17T20:13:07.976Z","target":"https://drthyang.github.io/web-refinement/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt"